{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:45 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:45 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:45 2026-10-29 HKT</p><img alt=\"TVB10月跨平台成績表亮麗 《璀璨之城》首10集狂吸2,300萬觀看 《三代同糖》點擊飆升110%\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b10ec0b5e212fd2b453d2e5c3c2d633f/2026-10/cats_144.jpg\"/><p>踏入台慶月，TVB台慶劇集及綜藝節目齊齊迎來好消息。根據tvb.com 昨日公布，台慶劇10月份跨平台（TVB香港社交平台 + OTT）成績表現理想，引爆全城熱話的《璀璨之城》，首十集網路影片觀看次數突破2,300萬。</p><h2>《三代同糖》點擊比9月多670萬</h2><p>而為迎接台慶不斷加入新元素的台慶處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》，10月的網絡影片點擊亦同樣報捷上升，比起9月份多了670萬點擊，升幅超過110%，成績亮麗。</p><img alt=\"歐瑞偉與樊亦敏今個星期開始加入《愛‧回家》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c1d09c5adcac08caf763e3274f2b621d/2026-10/02_6_39.jpg\"/><img alt=\"樊亦敏以另一個身份加人劇中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/227e5827bb000edb1d0e0b4f1d8e500d/2026-10/02a_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"歐瑞偉演保安員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/77a24bfc7ef16caf9ff87d8c18f466ef/2026-10/03_3_34.jpg\"/><img alt=\"安德尊也有份客串。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/78cc4c0fe80c97262500c19a83f850a8/2026-10/04_3_27.jpg\"/><img alt=\"車婉婉與樊亦敏齊以古裝亮相，令人驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4cbe5f775b43acb72f12c87a151a7ea0/2026-10/05a_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"張智霖與江美儀大鬥演技。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e1487267f43ad2e2286e58cff76e4dcc/2026-10/07_3_14.jpg\"/><img alt=\"張智霖在《璀璨之城》挑戰奸角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/72d12712fde99bc40781e046f555f6cc/2026-10/08_5_9.jpg\"/><img alt=\"江美儀老妝look令人驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7bd9a76fbcda08c8edab8fa364bd6fde/2026-10/09_2_11.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:40.968372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:45:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:38:41.441191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:33.362096+00:00","content_hash":"300cd4fa95e01bb298acbfe7cdb1474c7d27ab